{"server":"tw","storyId":"main_6_level_main_06-05_end","groupId":"main_6","stageId":"main_06-05","title":"解決誰？","storyCode":"6-5","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/main/level_main_06-05_end.txt","sourceHash":"1c3e7752eb959bcfc1e15c95690d70a4235bfc8028a11b217a76e5738f3c030a","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"第二关（后）"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_d"},{"type":"narration","text":"與此同時，貧民區的另一處"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"不要慌張！慢慢說！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但、但所有......所有同胞，都死了啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"發生什麼了？發生什麼了？！我們什麼也沒看到！什麼也沒看見就！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔咕！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"情況，向我報告！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"向我報告！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......呼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"什麼人！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......這個味道，別被迷惑！隊友都還在！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"聽我指揮！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"啊啊！紅，紅色的！！我看到了！！是紅色的！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"讓他安靜！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"......（非人的笑聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我......我，我想回烏薩斯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這裡有鬼！怪物！我看到兩個女人的影子！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃，呃呃！！我想回去，想回去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"整合運動成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"弑君者，我們不該來，不該來！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"回話！快回話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"龍門貧民區的地形很複雜，不要被敵人干擾了！我們很安全！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"（明明已經釋放濃霧了，為什麼我們的位置還是曝光了？）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"剩下那個叛徒的位置，我已經知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"塔露拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"她就在龍門，去刺殺她，去鞏固你的名字，去讓你的敵人感到恐怖。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"......！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"霜星","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"殺完你的仇人，然後呢，你又該做什麼？別忘了誰是真正的敵人。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"弑君者","speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","isRemote":false,"text":"——誰！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_indoor_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"給我接那個傢伙！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，詩小姐，你在說誰？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"那個傢伙！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"呃，啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"（她在說誰啊？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（可能是說那個吧......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"粉頭髮的下水道生物！100800-00200-rct211-93001！撥這個號碼，她的電話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"警員","speakerId":"char_015_lmg","isRemote":false,"text":"（這麼長？她怎麼背得下來的？！）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"近衛局成員","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（......這個號碼，我有印象，是不是那家的小姐？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"還在交頭接耳個什麼！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"您好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"臭老鼠！你在幹嘛！是不是你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......你為什麼會懷疑我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"不是你就好啊，哎，讓我白擔心一場......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我懷疑你什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"如果你是說特殊部隊。是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"林雨霞，我聽錯了吧，我聽錯了對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局有近衛局該做的，我們有我們該做的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"魏彥吾想你們維護龍門的秩序，而我們去除那些龍門不需要的東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"這支隊伍，你知道他們在貧民區裡做什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們有好好幫你們消滅整合運動啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"好不容易搭建起來的龍門緩衝社區，這是你父親的心血！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"如果沒有你父親的努力，現在的龍門怎麼可能是這樣？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道他們的目標？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你們已經定好了，說貧民區是整合運動最大的潛藏點和入侵管道，想要毀掉貧民區！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我說的對不對？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在和羅德島聯手，整合運動完全不是我們的對手！你們不該做這些！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"又在別人說明之前自顧自地猜測......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"雖然整合運動確實不堪一擊，但他們從來都不是民間力量能解決的問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"運用真正的城邦力量清除威脅，這是我該做的。這是對抗入侵者的必需手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"為什麼不相信羅德島和我們近衛局？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我們不信任羅德島。以及，為什麼要弄髒近衛局的手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"......髒手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"別告訴我你們要做絕。那裡有你父親的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"跟破壞比起來，建設要艱難得多！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"砸壞一塊玻璃，只需要一個人一秒鐘......而造一塊玻璃，你知道需要幾道流程，多少時間嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"詩懷雅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你知道市民們在害怕什麼？你知道商會在忌憚什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"你頭腦鏽了嗎，現在我們不就是在對抗整合運動嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你果然什麼都不懂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"行啊，臭老鼠......我不懂，我能否有幸請您為我解釋清楚呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感染者......在不斷增加。市民恐懼的是感染者，他們不會管這些感染者是整合運動又或者不是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就這樣了。別去搜排水系統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"喂？喂？！臭老鼠！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"詩懷雅","speakerId":"char_308_swire","isRemote":false,"text":"*龍門粗口粗口粗口*！你敢掛我電話！！你居然敢掛我電話！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"黑蓑們被陳逼走了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"這可怎麼辦，我該怎麼辦......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......他們應該會跳過陳，暗地加快進度。嗯，就這麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"爸爸，如果當時的你是現在的我，你也會這麼做的，對吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_npc_036","isRemote":false,"text":"......我在做什麼呀我......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_outcity_1"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會？你說什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的牧群正在衰亡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然一開始它們的攻勢確實驚人，但......我們不知道這段時間裡發生了什麼。根據偵察，他們的數量並沒有繼續增長。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然這個戰術確實拖延了他們，但目前受到最大損傷的反而是一開始就遭到牧群襲擊的整合運動隊伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"誰？是誰能做到？近衛局......近衛局不可能壓制我的牧群！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"可我們的同胞......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"近衛局的戰術和裝備我都考慮過了，想對抗我的牧群，必須要花上至少兩天的時間，究竟是誰壓制了我的牧群？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"穿黑色雨披的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"隊長！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"弩手們，調整現在的隊伍！我和其他小隊吸引了許多梅菲斯特的隊員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"......為什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"集聚起來的他們能幫我們阻攔近衛局。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"浮士德，浮士德......你沒受傷吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"（為什麼剛才要離開？）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......因為我當時必須那麼做。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"看著你帶著這麼多同胞回來，真好。你也打算用他們的力量對抗近衛局吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"他們雖然不會攻擊我們，但我也不能指揮他們，剛剛還在為這件事苦惱呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在的數量不太夠啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要更多的同胞去保護我們，必須要戰勝那些近衛局，我們才能撤退。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......."},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"梅菲斯特，別再用那個法術了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梅菲斯特","speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","isRemote":false,"text":"可浮士德以前說過，要活下去吧？這是最重要的吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......那你為什麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"在近衛局大樓，你為什麼說要為那個怪物而死？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"弩手們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"幻影弩手","speakerId":"avg_npc_016","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"浮士德","speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","isRemote":false,"text":"控制住他。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[{"speakerId":"char_015_lmg","aliases":["警員"]},{"speakerId":"char_1502_crowns","aliases":["弑君者"]},{"speakerId":"char_1507_Mephisto","aliases":["梅菲斯特"]},{"speakerId":"char_1508_Faust","aliases":["浮士德"]},{"speakerId":"char_308_swire","aliases":["詩懷雅"]}]}
